Well, since I no longer believe that UI is primarily for expressing (etc.) 
emotions (etc.), but about indicating spectra.  I have only the logical problem 
-- shouldn't these be bridi?  -- with 'dai'  (which I never did have a problem 
with as empathetic emotion, only wondering why it was restricted to second 
person) or even 'da'ai' in its full unemotional form (assuming 'dai' can be 
extended to cover third party cases).




